# promise: #413
# An incognito window's pages all load in one off-the-record context, so its space header's menu
# offers no Set Profile (the checkmark moved and nothing changed), and none of what the window's
# Spaces menu turns off there: Live Folders, Export into Folder, Manage Spaces…, Delete Space
# (GitHub #413). A normal window's header keeps Arc's whole menu.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=normal
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
wait 1
cra://debug?spaceMenu=normal
expect-log space menu normal: Change Space Icon…\|Rename Space…\|Edit Theme Color…\|Set Profile ▸\|Search Engine ▸\|──\|.*Live Folders ▸\|──\|Export .*\|Delete Space$
cra://action/newIncognitoWindow
wait 2
cra://debug?spaceMenu=incognito&window=incognito
expect-log space menu incognito: Change Space Icon…\|Rename Space…\|Edit Theme Color…\|Search Engine ▸\|──\|New Folder[^|]*$
